  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="how">
    <h2 id="how">How it works</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <h3>Pick what you're allergic to</h3>
        <p class="text-secondary">Grass, birch, oak, ragweed, cedar… Respira only shows you yours, and only the ones reported where you are.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Check today and the days ahead</h3>
        <p class="text-secondary">The level of each pollen at your location, with the source of every reading. When there is no reading, it says so instead of showing a zero.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Log how you feel</h3>
        <p class="text-secondary">The diary keeps your symptoms and medication next to that day's pollen, so you can see what actually sets you off.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

